 dimensions to a containing element. This addon requires xterm.js v4+.\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install --save @xterm/addon-fit\n```\n\n### Usage\n\n```ts\nimport { Terminal } from '@xterm/xterm';\nimport { FitAddon } from '@xterm/addon-fit';\n\nconst terminal = new Terminal();\nconst fitAddon = new FitAddon();\nterminal.loadAddon(fitAddon);\nterminal.open(containerElement);\nfitAddon.fit();\n```\n\nSee the full [API](https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js/blob/master/addons/addon-fit/typings/addon-fit.d.ts) for more advanced usage.\n","repository":{"type":"git","url":"git+https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js.git#master"},"_source_registry_name":"default"}